      "t": "Inside Arkady's room and the hallway a moment later. Last time, Lyolya visited Arkady to complain about Osipenko's advances and tried to give him a back massage. In the middle of it, Arkady steps on a loose screw from the floor and suddenly remembers that he forgot to tell Marina something urgent about her son's surgery. Let's listen in Russian first.",
